%I A400327 #47 Nov 26 2026 16:30:01
%S A400327 5,73,2674,76913,1134068,186764394,14542026085,686770523397,
%T A400327 184430518825474,19483947774555901
%N A400327 Smallest positive integer that can be written as the sum of n distinct positive n-th powers and also as the sum of n+1 distinct positive (n+1)-th powers.
%H A400327 Ujjayanta Bhaumik, <a href="/A400327/a400327.txt">Python program for A400327</a>
%F A400327 a(1) = min A004431, a(2) = min(A004431 intersect A024975), a(3) = min(A024975 intersect A176197), etc. - _M. F. Hasler_, Nov 17 2026
%e A400327 First terms:
%e A400327 5 = 5^1 = 1^2 + 2^2.
%e A400327 73 = 3^2 + 8^2 = 1^3 + 2^3 + 4^3.
%e A400327 2674 = 7^3 + 10^3 + 11^3 = 1^4 + 2^4 + 4^4 + 7^4.
%e A400327 76913 = 3^4 + 6^4 + 10^4 + 16^4 = 1^5 + 2^5 + 4^5 + 7^5 + 9^5.
%e A400327 1134068 = 2^5 + 3^5 + 5^5 + 13^5 + 15^5 = 1^6 + 2^6 + 3^6 + 5^6 + 7^6 + 10^6.
%e A400327 For the larger examples, let us use the notation Sum S^k := Sum_{x in S} x^k. Then:
%e A400327 a(6) = 186764394 = Sum {1, 2, 12, 18, 20, 21}^6 = Sum {3, 4, 6, 7, 9, 10, 15}^7,
%e A400327 a(7) = 14542026085 = Sum {2, 6, 13, 14, 16, 18, 28}^7 = Sum {2, 3, 5, 9, 10, 13, 15, 18}^8,
%e A400327 a(8) = 686770523397 = Sum {1, 2, 8, 15, 17, 19, 27, 28}^8 = Sum {7, 8, 10, 11, 12, 15, 17, 18, 19}^9,
%e A400327 a(9) = 184430518825474 = Sum {4, 12, 15, 18, 19, 24, 26, 28, 38}^9 = Sum {6, 8, 10, 14, 15, 17, 18, 20, 22, 26}^10,
%e A400327 a(10) = 19483947774555901 = Sum {3, 9, 10, 16, 17, 23, 28, 34, 36, 41}^10 = Sum {2, 7, 8, 11, 14, 16, 18, 19, 24, 27, 29}^11.
%o A400327 (Python) # See Links section.
%Y A400327 Cf. A001481 (sums of 2 squares), A001661 (not sum of n distinct n-th powers > 0), A003072 (sums of 3 cubes > 0), A393788 (sum of n cubes > 0 in n ways, all cubes distinct), A347362 (exactly n sums of 3 distinct cubes > 0, but not...), A146756 (least sum of n distinct n-th powers > 0 in n ways), A400781 (sum of n distinct n-th powers > 0 in n ways, no n-th power repeated).
%Y A400327 Cf. A004431 (sums of two distinct squares > 0), A024975 (sums of 3 distinct cubes > 0), A176197 (sums of 4 distinct 4th powers).
%K A400327 nonn,more,changed
%O A400327 1,1
%A A400327 _Jean-Marc Rebert_, Oct 22 2026
%E A400327 a(10) from _Ujjayanta Bhaumik_, Nov 11 2026
